歳、フィンタンは7歳。リューは働き者で、いつも助けたがります。フィンタンはチャーミングでエネルギッシュ。二人とも両親を尊敬し、とても愛している。\n\nセージとポテンティラの花を添えてください。これらの花は両親と両親への愛を表しています。セージの花は賢者レイフを表しています。ポテンティラの花は \"ナナ \"と呼ばれる種類で、最愛の子供を意味します。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/6CYNbCu\n\nご清聴ありがとうございました！", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 443348, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "wss.s", "screen_name": "wsss_rauha", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1373565254181953540/N_owhCfL.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1190246398509211648/1613312756/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 32}, {"id": 2182033, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "白猫のシオン", "screen_name": "shionshironeko2", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1546500203523387392/BxPOSgKV.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1017041463627079681/1594717550/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 1}, {"id": 2540280, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "紀柳沙羅", "screen_name": "Kiryuu_Sara", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1654107911726206978/2TcpX2Fv.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1279540220975669248/1704970587/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 145}, {"id": 2975017, "creator"